[ ] Add a doctor fix or prune mode for orphaned sidecar state $clearhead doctor is read-only, and there is no fix, prune, repair, or gc command anywhere, so orphaned sidecar state has no sanctioned remediation and accumulates. Two kinds seen 2026-07-18: stale next.json entries for actions removed from the actions file and its archive, and sidecar files whose companion actions file was deleted. Add a doctor prune or fix mode that removes both, ideally with a dry-run preview, so cleanup does not require hand-editing machine-managed sidecars.$ !2 #019f783e-bc73-7dc1-992b-5dce1fe13209
